+# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
+# DOMINION ENERGY, INC. (NYSE: D) — regulated electric & gas utility.
+#
+# A rate-regulated utility earns on rate base plus fuel/O&M recovery, so the
+# headline story is Operating revenue -> Operating earnings -> earnings after
+# corporate overhead, by reportable segment. Same gross-margin/spread mapping
