+#
+#   volume (bal_base)  -> segment operating revenue ($MM)  -> "Operating revenue ($M)"
+#   yield_rate         -> operating-earnings margin %       -> "Operating margin %"
+#   Net Revenue column -> revenue x margin = SEGMENT OPERATING EARNINGS -> "Operating earnings ($M)"
+#   opex_ratio         -> corporate overhead as a share of segment earnings
+#   Contribution col   -> earnings after Corporate & Other  -> "Earnings after overhead ($M)"
+#   units_base         -> retail customers (K)              -> "Customers (K)"
+#   delinq_rate        -> reliability / rate-case risk       (the risk signal)
+#
+# Calibrated to FY2025 (reported early 2026):
+#   Operating revenue $16,506M  (Virginia ~$11,550M, South Carolina ~$3,702M,
+#   Contracted Energy $1,254M)
+#   Segment operating earnings: DEV $2,325M, DESC $535M, Contracted $438M
+#   Consolidated operating earnings $2,966M (after Corporate & Other -$332M)
+#   ~3.6M regulated electric customers (VA/NC/SC) + ~0.5M SC gas customers.
